    "description": "decision approve needs reviewed_words equal to the words now in the row, a received row, and a consent that allows showing: then the row is approved and pinned to the speaker, the words and the consent together. decline marks a received row declined. withdraw (the person took their consent back, or the owner took the words down) works on any row and stops it showing at once. The write is refused if the row changed since it was read. Returns row_id and status.",
    "input_schema": {
     "type": "object",
     "additionalProperties": false,
     "required": [
